---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Gestión de convocatoria">
  <main class="recruitment-admin">
    <section id="recruitment-login" class="login-panel panel" aria-labelledby="login-title">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← Inicio</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">UNICODE · GTH</p>
      <h1 id="login-title">Gestión de convocatoria</h1>
      <p class="muted">Ingresa con el acceso administrativo de UNICODE.</p>
      <form id="recruitment-login-form" class="stack">
        <label>Contraseña<input id="recruitment-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required /></label>
        <button type="submit" class="primary">Ingresar</button>
        <p id="recruitment-login-message" class="message" role="alert" hidden></p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <div id="recruitment-dashboard" hidden>
      <header class="admin-header">
        <div>
          <a class="back-link" href="/">← Inicio</a>
          <p class="eyebrow">UNICODE · GTH</p>
          <h1>Gestión de convocatoria</h1>
          <p class="muted">Configuración, seguimiento y comunicaciones.</p>
        </div>
        <button id="recruitment-logout" class="secondary">Cerrar sesión</button>
      </header>

      <p id="admin-message" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      <nav class="admin-nav" aria-label="Secciones de gestión">
        <button type="button" data-panel="configuration" aria-current="page">Configuración</button>
        <button type="button" data-panel="applications">Postulaciones <span id="application-count" class="count">0</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-panel="communications">Comunicaciones</button>
      </nav>

      <section id="panel-configuration" aria-labelledby="config-title">
        <form id="recruitment-config-form" class="stack">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><h2 id="config-title">Convocatoria</h2><p class="muted">Las fechas se guardan en horario de Lima (UTC−5).</p></div>
            <span id="config-state" class="badge">Cargando…</span>
          </div>
          <div id="connection-status" class="button-row" aria-label="Configuración de conexiones"></div>
          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Publicación y plazos</legend>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <label class="wide">Nombre de convocatoria<input name="title" maxlength="120" required /></label>
              <label>Apertura<input name="opensAt" type="datetime-local" /></label>
              <label>Cierre<input name="closesAt" type="datetime-local" /></label>
              <label>Prórroga <span class="optional">Opcional</span><input name="extensionAt" type="datetime-local" /></label>
              <label>Máximo de postulantes<input name="maxApplicants" type="number" min="1" max="150" step="1" required /><small>Hasta 150 postulaciones completas.</small></label>
              <label>Horas de inactividad para recordar<input name="inactivityHours" type="number" min="1" max="720" step="1" required /></label>
              <label class="wide">Caso corto<textarea name="shortCasePrompt" rows="3" maxlength="2000" required></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <label class="check-line"><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" /> Habilitar convocatoria dentro del plazo configurado</label>
            <p class="muted note">Para abrir, configura fechas, al menos un área y dos preguntas activas por categoría.</p>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Áreas y cupos</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Los porcentajes se calculan sobre los cupos de las áreas habilitadas. El límite de registro es el máximo general.</p>
            <div id="area-config" class="area-grid"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Video de presentación</legend>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <label>Duración máxima<input type="text" value="60 segundos" disabled /></label>
              <label>Preguntas por categoría<input type="text" value="2 (4 preguntas en total)" disabled /></label>
              <label>Almacenamiento<select name="storageProvider"><option value="drive">Google Drive</option><option value="supabase">Supabase Storage</option></select><small>El cambio afecta a nuevas subidas; los videos anteriores conservan su proveedor.</small></label>
              <label>Preparación en segundos<input name="preparationSeconds" type="number" min="0" max="300" step="1" required /></label>
              <label>Tamaño máximo en MB<input name="maxVideoMB" type="number" min="1" max="20" step="1" required /></label>
            </div>
            <p class="muted note">Grabación en la web y carga alternativa ante falla técnica. Las preguntas asignadas se conservan durante todo el proceso.</p>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Rúbrica del video</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Define los descriptores de evaluación. Cada criterio tiene un máximo de 5 puntos; la calificación corresponde al módulo de evaluación.</p>
            <div id="video-rubric-config" class="stack"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Criterios para integrar con la evaluación</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Estos valores quedan pendientes hasta que el equipo defina las escalas y la evaluación. Guardarlos no califica ni descarta automáticamente.</p>
            <div class="field-grid three">
              <label>Umbral de afinidad (%)<input name="thresholdAffinity" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" /></label>
              <label>Umbral escrito (%)<input name="thresholdWritten" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" /></label>
              <label>Umbral de video (0–15 puntos)<input name="thresholdVideo" type="number" min="0" max="15" step="0.01" /></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Banco de preguntas</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Cada postulante recibe dos preguntas distintas de cada categoría. Editar el banco afecta solo a nuevas asignaciones.</p>
            <div id="question-config" class="question-columns"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="save-bar">
            <p class="muted" id="config-save-info">Los cambios se aplican al guardar.</p>
            <button type="submit" class="primary" id="save-config">Guardar configuración</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section id="panel-applications" aria-labelledby="applications-title" hidden>
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><h2 id="applications-title">Postulaciones</h2><p class="muted">Datos, preguntas, video y cambios de estado.</p></div>
          <button id="refresh-applications" type="button" class="secondary">Actualizar</button>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack compact preview-panel">
          <div><h3>Modo de prueba</h3><p class="muted">Genera un enlace secreto para que el equipo postule en la web publicada aunque la convocatoria esté cerrada al público. Esas postulaciones aparecen como «Prueba» y se borran con sus videos cuando termines.</p></div>
          <p id="preview-state" class="muted" role="status"></p>
          <div class="button-row"><button id="preview-create" type="button" class="primary">Generar enlace de prueba</button><button id="preview-disable" type="button" class="secondary">Desactivar enlace</button><button id="purge-tests" type="button" class="secondary">Borrar postulaciones de prueba</button></div>
          <label id="preview-link-box" hidden>Enlace de prueba: cópialo ahora, no se volverá a mostrar<input id="preview-link" readonly /></label>
        </div>
        <div class="filters panel">
          <label>Estado<select id="filter-status"><option value="">Todos los estados</option></select></label>
          <label>Área<select id="filter-area"><option value="">Todas las áreas</option></select></label>
          <label class="search-field">Buscar por nombre o correo<input id="filter-search" type="search" placeholder="Nombre o correo" /></label>
        </div>
        <p id="applications-info" class="muted" role="status"></p>
        <div id="applications-list" class="app-list"></div>
        <section id="application-detail" class="panel detail-panel" aria-labelledby="detail-title" tabindex="-1" hidden>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">Detalle de postulación</p><h2 id="detail-title"></h2></div>
            <button id="close-detail" type="button" class="secondary">Cerrar detalle</button>
          </div>
          <div id="detail-personal" class="detail-grid"></div>
          <div id="detail-answers" class="stack compact"></div>
          <h3>Preguntas asignadas</h3>
          <div id="detail-questions" class="question-columns"></div>
          <div class="video-summary">
            <div><h3>Video</h3><p id="detail-video-info" class="muted"></p></div>
            <button id="open-video" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>Abrir video privado</button>
          </div>
          <p id="video-access-message" class="muted" role="status" hidden></p>
          <form id="transition-form" class="transition-box">
            <h3>Actualizar estado</h3>
            <p class="muted note">La sesión administrativa es compartida; el historial registra ese acceso, la fecha y el motivo.</p>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <label>Siguiente estado<select id="next-status" required></select></label>
              <label>Motivo del cambio<textarea id="transition-reason" rows="2" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="primary" id="save-transition">Guardar cambio de estado</button>
          </form>
          <h3>Historial</h3>
          <ol id="detail-history" class="history"></ol>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section id="panel-communications" aria-labelledby="communications-title" hidden>
        <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="communications-title">Comunicaciones</h2><p class="muted">Plantillas y estado de envío de correos.</p></div></div>
        <section class="panel stack" aria-labelledby="queue-title">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><h3 id="queue-title">Cola de correos</h3><p class="muted note">Los reintentos conservan la misma solicitud de correo.</p></div>
            <div class="button-row"><button id="refresh-emails" type="button" class="secondary">Actualizar</button><button id="process-emails" type="button" class="primary">Procesar pendientes</button></div>
          </div>
          <div id="email-summary" class="stats"></div>
          <div id="email-list" class="email-list"></div>
          <p id="email-process-result" class="muted" role="status" hidden></p>
        </section>
        <form id="templates-form" class="stack">
          <div><h3>Plantillas</h3><p class="muted note">Texto plano. Variables permitidas: <span id="template-variables"></span></p></div>
          <div id="template-list" class="stack"></div>
          <div class="save-bar"><p class="muted">Cada etapa genera una única solicitud de correo.</p><button type="submit" class="primary">Guardar plantillas</button></div>
        </form>
      </section>
    </div>
    <noscript><p class="message">Activa JavaScript para acceder a la gestión de convocatoria.</p></noscript>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  import "../../scripts/recruitment-admin";
</script>

<style is:global>
  .recruitment-admin { --admin-green: #75d32d; --admin-border: #293029; --admin-muted: #a7b0a7; width: min(1160px, 100%); margin-inline: auto; padding: 28px 20px 64px; }
  .recruitment-admin [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .recruitment-admin .login-panel { max-width: 460px; margin: max(40px, 12vh) auto; }
  .recruitment-admin h1 { font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; }
  .recruitment-admin h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .recruitment-admin h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .recruitment-admin p { line-height: 1.65; }
  .recruitment-admin .muted { color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: .85rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .eyebrow { color: var(--admin-green); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .1em; margin: 15px 0 6px; }
  .recruitment-admin .back-link { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--admin-muted); }
  .recruitment-admin .back-link:hover { color: var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header, .recruitment-admin .section-heading, .recruitment-admin .save-bar, .recruitment-admin .video-summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header { margin-bottom: 28px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header > button { margin-top: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .section-heading { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .recruitment-admin .stack { display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  .recruitment-admin .compact { gap: 14px; }
  .recruitment-admin .panel { background: #101510; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; min-width: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin fieldset { margin: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin legend { color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0 7px; }
  .recruitment-admin label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: .8rem; color: #e1e7e1; }
  .recruitment-admin input:not([type="checkbox"]), .recruitment-admin select, .recruitment-admin textarea { width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: #080c08; border: 1px solid #3a433a; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px 12px; font: inherit; color: #fff; color-scheme: dark; }
  .recruitment-admin textarea { resize: vertical; line-height: 1.6; }
  .recruitment-admin input:disabled { color: var(--admin-muted); opacity: .85; }
  .recruitment-admin small, .recruitment-admin .optional { color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: .72rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .optional { display: inline; }
  .recruitment-admin input[type="checkbox"] { width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--admin-green); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin .check-line { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; margin-top: 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .field-grid, .recruitment-admin .question-columns, .recruitment-admin .detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .recruitment-admin .field-grid.three { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .recruitment-admin .wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .recruitment-admin .note { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .check-line + .note { margin: 14px 0 0; }
  .recruitment-admin button { cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s, border-color .15s; }
  .recruitment-admin button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: wait; }
  .recruitment-admin :is(button, a, input, select, textarea):focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--admin-green); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .recruitment-admin .primary, .recruitment-admin .secondary { border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px 16px; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; }
  .recruitment-admin .primary { background: var(--admin-green); color: #101510; border: 1px solid var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin .primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #94e65a; }
  .recruitment-admin .secondary { border: 1px solid #3a433a; color: #e1e7e1; background: #141b14; }
  .recruitment-admin .secondary:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin .message { padding: 13px 16px; border-radius: 9px; border: 1px solid #436d2b; background: #15300f; font-size: .85rem; margin: 16px 0; }
  .recruitment-admin .message.error { border-color: #903e43; background: #311416; color: #ffc3c6; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 30px; background: #0b100b; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding: 12px; border-radius: 7px; color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: .85rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--admin-green); background: #1b2b15; }
  .recruitment-admin .count { display: inline-block; margin-left: 4px; font-size: .7rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; border: 1px solid #42593b; background: #182415; color: #b0e88e; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .7rem; padding: 5px 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .recruitment-admin .area-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .recruitment-admin .area-card { border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .area-card .check-line { margin: 0 0 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .recruitment-admin .question-group { display: grid; align-content: start; gap: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .question-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--admin-border); padding-bottom: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .question-item .check-line { margin-top: 10px; font-size: .75rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .save-bar { position: sticky; bottom: 16px; background: #101510f5; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; z-index: 5; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .recruitment-admin .filters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.5fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .app-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .app-card { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 20px; background: #101510; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 12px; }
  .recruitment-admin .app-card h3 { margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .recruitment-admin .app-card p { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .app-card .app-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .recruitment-admin .detail-panel { margin-top: 24px; display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  .recruitment-admin .detail-panel .section-heading { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin .detail-grid > div { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .detail-grid dt { color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: .72rem; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .recruitment-admin .detail-grid dd { font-size: .85rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .answer-text { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .85rem; color: #e1e7e1; margin-top: 6px; }
  .recruitment-admin .assigned-questions { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; list-style: decimal; font-size: .85rem; color: #e1e7e1; }
  .recruitment-admin .assigned-questions li { margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .recruitment-admin .transition-box { display: grid; gap: 16px; border-block: 1px solid var(--admin-border); padding-block: 24px; }
  .recruitment-admin .transition-box .note { margin: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin .transition-box > button { justify-self: start; }
  .recruitment-admin .history { display: grid; gap: 16px; list-style: none; }
  .recruitment-admin .history li { border-left: 2px solid #48673a; padding-left: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .history .muted { font-size: .72rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .button-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .recruitment-admin .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .recruitment-admin .stat { background: #080c08; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; }
  .recruitment-admin .stat strong { display: block; color: var(--admin-green); font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .stat span { color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: .72rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .email-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .recruitment-admin .email-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: start; gap: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--admin-border); padding-top: 12px; font-size: .8rem; }
  .recruitment-admin .email-row p { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .template-card { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .preview-panel { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .badge.test { border-color: #a16207; background: #422006; color: #fde68a; }
  .recruitment-admin .template-card .check-line { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .recruitment-admin { padding: 20px 14px 48px; }
    .recruitment-admin .panel { padding: 18px; }
    .recruitment-admin .field-grid, .recruitment-admin .field-grid.three, .recruitment-admin .question-columns, .recruitment-admin .area-grid, .recruitment-admin .filters { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .recruitment-admin .admin-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .recruitment-admin .admin-header > button { margin: 0; }
    .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button { padding: 11px 5px; font-size: .73rem; }
    .recruitment-admin .section-heading, .recruitment-admin .save-bar, .recruitment-admin .app-card, .recruitment-admin .video-summary { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .recruitment-admin .save-bar { bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; }
    .recruitment-admin .save-bar .primary { width: 100%; }
    .recruitment-admin .detail-grid { gap: 16px; }
    .recruitment-admin .email-row { flex-direction: column; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .recruitment-admin * { transition: none !important; } }
</style>
